{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 6580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 4620, "text": "This little piggy went to market."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 13560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 8680, "text": "And this little piggy stayed home. Sir,\ndon't, please. I can't eat when you're"}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 14539, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 13560, "text": "doing that."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 17120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 14540, "text": "Sorry. I thought you liked finger food."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 21480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 18540, "text": "Actually, Christine, I'm surprised you\ncan think of eating with that roach on"}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 22480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 21480, "text": "your bread."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 25040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 23800, "text": "Kill it! Kill it!"}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 29720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 28720, "text": "You got it!"}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 31860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 30140, "text": "No, that one was already there."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 36310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 34730, "text": "Where'd all these roaches come from,\nanyway?"}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 40590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 36630, "text": "From the 17th floor. All that\nconstruction they're doing is driving"}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 41229, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 40590, "text": "up here."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 42230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 41230, "text": "There's another one."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 43610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 42610, "text": "Don't move!"}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 50150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 47830, "text": "You're spraying poison all over our\nfood."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 52770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 50550, "text": "Oh, so now you're siding with the\nroaches against me, sir?"}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 56090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 53330, "text": "It's only natural to root for the higher\nlife form."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 60710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 58810, "text": "Oh, I sure don't feel like eating now."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 61950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 60950, "text": "Me neither."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 65250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 64250, "text": "I'll save this for later."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 70690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 68650, "text": "Oh, there's another one."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 74690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 71350, "text": "Why does something like this always seem\nto happen when I've got a guest coming?"}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 75990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 74990, "text": "A guest?"}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 78750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 76030, "text": "Two in one year. How do you juggle it\nall?"}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 82630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 80370, "text": "Actually, it's really no big deal. He's\njust my pen pal."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 83990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 82990, "text": "Pen pal?"}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 85210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 84010, "text": "That is so cute."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 88070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 86790, "text": "Where's the little guy from?"}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 89570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 88550, "text": "Attica State Prison."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 92490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 90230, "text": "He's a convict? Oh, he just got out."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 95050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 93050, "text": "I met him when my women -in -law group\nvisited the prison."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 98290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 95690, "text": "Must have been a disappointing field\ntrip. I hear a couple of years in the"}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 100190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 98350, "text": "those guys lose their eyes for the\nladies."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 104090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 102710, "text": "Dan, give the guy a break."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 105930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 104450, "text": "James has paid his debt to society."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 108190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 106610, "text": "So he wrote a few bad checks."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 111190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 108510, "text": "We've all committed some transgression\nat one time or another."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 113370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 112370, "text": "Even me."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 115710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 113950, "text": "You? Come on, what'd you do?"}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 118410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 116190, "text": "Well, I'm not proud of it, but once I..."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 121920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 119699, "text": "Stole some cookies from a rival Girl\nScout troop."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 126560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 124080, "text": "And you're still on the streets."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 132280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 128419, "text": "My point is, I think it's important to\nhelp James make a smooth transition back"}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 133280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 132280, "text": "into society."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 137180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 133420, "text": "Well, count me out. I've got no time for\npeople who think they're too good for"}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 138019, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 137180, "text": "the law."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 139360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 138020, "text": "I'm looking for Christine Sullivan."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 141740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 139980, "text": "James, we were just talking about you."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 144260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 142760, "text": "I'm only going to say this once."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 148040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 145780, "text": "Champagne's in the fridge. The address\nis on the key."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 196130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 194730, "text": "Do you think a roach could get in one of\nthese?"}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 199690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 197170, "text": "Oh, come on, guys. It's no worse than\nusual."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 201009, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 200030, "text": "Oh, yeah?"}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 202230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 201010, "text": "Well, tell that to your donut."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 205990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 203770, "text": "Hey! Hey, you! Get back here!"}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 211430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 208010, "text": "This steroid use is really getting out\nof hand."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 214470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 213470, "text": "Sir!"}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 218170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 216470, "text": "Oh, I know that look."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 222210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 219250, "text": "Yeah, they must have gotten a new speed\nbag at Roz's gym."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 227470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 224250, "text": "Bull, I think Christine Medros is in\nlove."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 229110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 228110, "text": "Yeah, right."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 234210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 231590, "text": "So, how was your carriage ride through\nCentral Park?"}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 235990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 234910, "text": "Is that where we were?"}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 237750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 236750, "text": "Beats me."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 242370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 237850, "text": "All I know is, this is probably the most\nromantic day I've spent in a long time."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 246050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 243010, "text": "It better be. You spent the last two\nyears in jail."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 250830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 247250, "text": "Well, baby, you gotta get ready for\nwork, and I got some phone calls to"}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 252670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 251670, "text": "I'll catch you later."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 275470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 273930, "text": "You and James seem to be hitting it off."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 277330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 276330, "text": "He's okay."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 280190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 278590, "text": "Oh, come on. He's just okay?"}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 281630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 280630, "text": "It's been a week."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 282870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 281870, "text": "You can tell me."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 287650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 283490, "text": "Does James, um... Make me howl like a\ncoyote till the sun comes up?"}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 291310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 290070, "text": "Oh, I didn't really mean that."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 294290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 293290, "text": "Does he?"}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 297870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 294570, "text": "Let me put it this way. My neighbors\nhave started sleeping days."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 305120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 302480, "text": "Thoughtful of you to take time out to\ntalk to our law class today."}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 307940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 305400, "text": "My pleasure. You know, I always get as\nmuch from it as the students."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 310100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 309100, "text": "More, if I'm lucky."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 313160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 312160, "text": "Coffee? Oh."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 317540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 313400, "text": "Oh, no, thanks. I'd better get to the\nlibrary before it closes, but thanks for"}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 318279, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 317540, "text": "the tour."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 321240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 318280, "text": "You're very welcome. Listen, why don't\nyou come back later? We can compare"}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 324080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 321240, "text": "notes. I'll show you mine if you show me\nyours."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 325980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 324980, "text": "That would be great."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 327599, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 326740, "text": "Bye -bye."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 328600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 327600, "text": "Bye."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 331020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 330020, "text": "Watch it, jerk."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 340080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 339020, "text": "You mean you're not going to kill me?"}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 344040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 341280, "text": "Actually, I should tighten your belt\nuntil your eyes pop out."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 346940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 345940, "text": "But it's spring."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 356080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 354040, "text": "We'll make it $50 in time, sir."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 369250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 366570, "text": "I've been helping Art, and so far we\nmust have gotten at least 2 ,000."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 371190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 370190, "text": "Where do you want them?"}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 378410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 373890, "text": "Well, you can try to find them all\nhomes, or you can smash them silly."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 380610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 379310, "text": "I'll get right on the phone, sir."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 384250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 382950, "text": "Call the next case, Mac."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 386130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 384530, "text": "People versus the Willigers?"}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 390550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 386810, "text": "Prosecution. Yes, sir. They're charged\nwith unlawful display of affection."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 392530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 391490, "text": "It was my fault."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 396090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 393790, "text": "She's so beautiful, I lost my head."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 397540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 396520, "text": "No, it was mine."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 401000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 398240, "text": "One look in your eyes and the law\ndoesn't matter."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 403460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 402460, "text": "Woo!"}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 407000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 405800, "text": "Get down!"}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 411000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 409980, "text": "All right, order!"}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 412320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 411320, "text": "Order!"}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 416760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 413500, "text": "Your Honor, the statute they violated is\nnow dated blue law."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 419020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 417040, "text": "I mean, what's the matter with\ndisplaying a little affection?"}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 421980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 420020, "text": "Oh, for Pete's sake, cut that out!"}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 428460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 424400, "text": "Your Honor, I'm all for it. but the, uh,\nslurping Walendas here."}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 432700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 429880, "text": "We're displaying it on the counter at\nBurger King."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 436240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 433700, "text": "Gives a whole new meaning to the phrase,\nhold the pickle."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 447900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 441880, "text": "I want to find the defendant's $50 and a\ncold shower."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 450040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 449020, "text": "Court's adjourned."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 452120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 450600, "text": "Keep up the good work."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 459900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 455500, "text": "I'm real happy that you found somebody\nthat you care about, but this is a court"}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 463600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 459900, "text": "of law, and I'd appreciate it if you\nwere a little less enthusiastic."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 467740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 464980, "text": "You are so cute when you're stern."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 473080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 471520, "text": "I'll stop that."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 475520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 474500, "text": "I'm sorry, Harry."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 479940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 476120, "text": "I guess since I met James, the whole\nworld seems like a more beautiful,"}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 480940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 479940, "text": "place."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 482160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 481160, "text": "That's sweet."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 484660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 482280, "text": "Now, I gotta go kick some butt in\nholding."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 490630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 486169, "text": "Oh, this is so great."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 493850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 490930, "text": "Have you ever seen anything more\nthrilling than two people in love?"}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 496670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 494090, "text": "Not since they unplugged the chair at\nSing Sing."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 499370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 498190, "text": "Can we help you?"}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 501710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 499810, "text": "You got a Christine Sullivan here?"}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 503250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 502250, "text": "That's me."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 505490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 503410, "text": "Detective Francis Griffin, NYPD."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 508430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 506630, "text": "Francis? That was my grandmother's name."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 512429, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 509930, "text": "Sure, and a manly woman she was, too."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 519299, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 515080, "text": "I understand you're pen pals with a con\nnamed James Morgan."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 522320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 519799, "text": "Yeah, we exchanged a few letters before\nhe was let out of prison."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 525360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 522760, "text": "He wasn't let out. He escaped."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 527840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 526540, "text": "And I want him back."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 531200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 529720, "text": "Frankly, I don't think he's your type."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 540920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 534940, "text": "There must be some mistake."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 542460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 541460, "text": "There's no mistake."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 546360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 543500, "text": "Morgan was on a two -day furlough and he\nwas due back a week ago."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 548060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 547000, "text": "No, this can't be."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 553100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 548900, "text": "James is a decent guy. He wrote to me\nfor two years and never, not once, was"}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 554240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 553100, "text": "there even postage due."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 558100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 555740, "text": "Your bleeding hearts amaze me."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 563140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 559480, "text": "Sure. Let's just send these creeps away\non a weekend retreat."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 567760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 563600, "text": "And when they come out, they'll steal\nyour car, they'll steal your girl,"}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 570900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 567760, "text": "leave you on a corner with your hands in\nyour pockets, and you feel like you got"}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 572500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 570900, "text": "a slug of hot lead in your gut."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 576850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 575850, "text": "I digress."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 580110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 578290, "text": "Now, where is Morgan?"}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 582250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 580590, "text": "He's not here. He left hours ago."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 583950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 582750, "text": "I got to call Edwards."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 587930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 584310, "text": "And you remember, I got my eye on all of\nyou."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 595150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 590090, "text": "I knew it. I knew it was something wrong\nwith that James the minute I met him."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 598190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 595270, "text": "It was those, those beady little eyes."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 600990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 598910, "text": "Yeah, never trust a man with a mustache."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 605330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 604270, "text": "That's new, isn't it?"}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 609070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 606650, "text": "Oh, God, how are we going to tell Roz?"}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 610690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 609690, "text": "Tell me what?"}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 614710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 613130, "text": "Well, what's the big secret?"}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 619770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 616230, "text": "That's a good question, Roz, and it\ndeserves a good answer."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 622390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 620870, "text": "Look, Roz, look."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 626970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 623570, "text": "The truth is, James is a liar."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 629210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 627290, "text": "He's not on parole. He escaped."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 642920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 640780, "text": "It's okay, Rosa. I mean, I know you're\nupset."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 646860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 644020, "text": "But it was my favorite sweater."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 651320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 648760, "text": "You should have thought about that\nbefore you lied about James."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 652960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 651960, "text": "James Morgan?"}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 656960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 654200, "text": "You know something about that lying two\n-bit thief?"}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 661040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 657460, "text": "Who are you and what part of your\nanatomy do you want me to plant my foot"}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 662040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 661040, "text": "first?"}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 664740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 663180, "text": "I'll ask the questions here."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 667060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 665120, "text": "Now tell me what you know about this\nMorgan."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 668480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 667360, "text": "She never even met him."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 671570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 668830, "text": "And they didn't spend the last week\nexchanging hickeys with their bailiff's"}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 672570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 671570, "text": "lounge either."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 676150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 673830, "text": "So, Bob, what do you got out there? Just\na hamster and a wheel?"}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 683770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 680930, "text": "So, you do know him."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 685610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 684170, "text": "You better not hide anything."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 689930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 686190, "text": "Because I'll charge you with aiding and\nabetting a fugitive."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 693670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 692330, "text": "So he really did escape?"}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 695810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 694810, "text": "I guess so."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 698860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 696840, "text": "You better tell this guy everything he\nwants to know."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 701260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 700260, "text": "So?"}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 703440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 702440, "text": "What's to tell?"}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 705260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 703780, "text": "I thought he got paroled."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 708560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 705680, "text": "So I guess you're not the only one he\nlied to."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 710980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 709280, "text": "Ross, I know how you feel."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 712220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 711220, "text": "Excuse me, Harry."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 714800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 713800, "text": "Where are you going?"}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 719940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 716400, "text": "Any place I don't have to watch Harry\ngive me that Phil Donahue look."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 734080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 730939, "text": "I just want to tell you how sorry I am\nabout this whole thing."}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 737360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 734440, "text": "Christine. No, really, this is all my\nfault. I should have seen it coming."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 739220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 737580, "text": "The evidence was right there in his\nhandwriting."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 742260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 739560, "text": "People who close their loops always have\nsomething to hide."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 745960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 742860, "text": "If I hadn't written to him and I hadn't\ninvited him here, you never would have"}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 747940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 745960, "text": "met him. None of this ever would have\nhappened. I feel like I practically"}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 749660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 747940, "text": "manufactured this whole thing by myself."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 752940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 751180, "text": "I'm the one who fell for James."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 755420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 753480, "text": "It's not your fault."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 766910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 761350, "text": "James, you big, dumb son of a... Sorry."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 771770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 768150, "text": "But I don't get why I have to fall in\nlove with guys who are bad for me."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 774590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 772870, "text": "I mean, you make it easy for animals."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 777690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 775250, "text": "All a dog has to do is jump the fence."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 781650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 779510, "text": "Forgive me for having higher standards."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 786530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 784590, "text": "That to James was a bad idea."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 790010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 788450, "text": "You were cooking that day."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 795880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 792640, "text": "But next time, make him honest."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 799800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 798320, "text": "I didn't mean to hurt you, Ross."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 805060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 802740, "text": "Where'd you find him? Trying to skip\ntown?"}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 807820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 805520, "text": "Actually, he found me. He was looking\nfor you."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 811000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 809700, "text": "I need to talk to you, Ross."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 812980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 811800, "text": "Is there someplace quiet?"}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 815560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 814080, "text": "Doesn't get any quieter than up here."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 819340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 818340, "text": "Ah."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 824570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 821470, "text": "Well, I could leave you in the custody\nof a fellow bailiff."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 831550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 830530, "text": "That was stupid."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 834470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 832010, "text": "He knows he's not supposed to leave you\nup here with me."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 837630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 836550, "text": "Because you might let me go?"}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 839990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 838270, "text": "Because I might throw you off the roof."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 845510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 841730, "text": "Boss, there's some things I have to tell\nyou. Like the fact that you escaped"}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 848330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 845510, "text": "from prison and you've been lying to me\nsince the day we met."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 851640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 850640, "text": "Uh, yeah."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 854280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 852880, "text": "Okay, okay, I admit it."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 856540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 854620, "text": "I didn't tell you I was going back to\nprison."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 858640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 857380, "text": "But then you never asked."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 863280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 858980, "text": "Oh, like I always ask my dates, do we\nhave to get you back in time for lockup?"}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 868320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 865500, "text": "Roz, I can't go back to that cell for\nanother two years."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 871680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 869940, "text": "Now that I know what we have between us."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 876420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 874420, "text": "Like something out of a romance novel."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 880500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 879020, "text": "I hate romance novels."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 883800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 882460, "text": "Now, Roz, hear me out."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 886360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 884860, "text": "I was thinking that we'd go somewhere."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 888520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 887520, "text": "Someplace romantic."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 892460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 889520, "text": "Like... Juarez."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 896760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 895400, "text": "Juarez? Yeah."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 900620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 897240, "text": "What am I supposed to do in Juarez? Open\na topless nacho stand?"}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 908500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 902440, "text": "Right now, it's just a concept, but...\nGuess I screwed up."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 913010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 909350, "text": "Not if you don't mind an extra three\nyears on the prison softball team."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 916730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 914770, "text": "Oh, no, Ross, I can't do that much time."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 922470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 920190, "text": "Maybe it's best that I just get the hell\nout of your life."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 932370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 930450, "text": "So, did you find everything you needed\nat the law library?"}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 934410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 933390, "text": "More than everything."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 937190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 935190, "text": "I saw a cockroach."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 939360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 937860, "text": "Oh, I hate those things."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 943960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 939600, "text": "Once I woke up and one was crawling on\nme, I was grossed out for days. Oh, I,"}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 946000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 944000, "text": "uh... I know what you mean."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 950260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 949220, "text": "I've got a great idea."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 952280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 950460, "text": "There's a little club right around this\ncorner here."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 953720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 952720, "text": "It's really nice."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 954960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 953960, "text": "Relaxed atmosphere."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 956180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 955180, "text": "Sit back."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 957540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 956420, "text": "Kick off your shoes."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 959040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 957740, "text": "And why stop there?"}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 963500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 960300, "text": "No, it's fine. And I just have a few\nmore questions to ask you anyway."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 965480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 964260, "text": "Okay. Shoot."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 970140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 966540, "text": "You know, in class, we've been studying\nGideon versus Wainwright, and I wondered"}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 972460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 970140, "text": "what you thought of the ruling as a\nprosecutor."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 976620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 972880, "text": "Uh -huh. Well, Gideon versus Wainwright.\nYou know, that's a fascinating case,"}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 981140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 976720, "text": "actually. I think that... You know what?\nI just remembered."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 984120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 981380, "text": "I think I have some notes on that back\nat my place."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 990880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 984360, "text": "Okay, correct me if I'm wrong, but it's\nmy view that that ruling actually"}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 994700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 990880, "text": "helped... the prosecutors by making them\nrely more on building a stronger case."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 997360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 995100, "text": "Oh, Sir Good Marshal, how you doing?"}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 998720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 997720, "text": "I didn't see him."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1004840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1001020, "text": "You just missed him. He's looking great,\nthough. Must be using that exercise."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1007440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1006040, "text": "Don't drink that. Why not?"}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1010160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1007700, "text": "Because this stuff will keep you up all\nnight."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1011940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1010500, "text": "And that's my job."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1016080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1012480, "text": "Hey, could you spare a few coins for a\ncup of coffee?"}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1017960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1016440, "text": "Here you go. It's your lucky day."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1025579, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1022920, "text": "You have such a wonderful sense of\nhumor, and you're so knowledgeable."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1028780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1026380, "text": "Can I use you as a source for my term\npaper?"}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1030740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1029740, "text": "Absolutely."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1033140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1032020, "text": "I'm out of legal pads."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1034540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1033540, "text": "Oh, wait. Ah -ha."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1035640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1034640, "text": "Mon chiquito."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1037339, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1036119, "text": "No problemo."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1039380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1038380, "text": "There you go."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1052930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1050890, "text": "And you wonder why people don't like you\nguys."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1057650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1055790, "text": "Why can't things be simpler?"}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1060890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1058190, "text": "Why do they always have to get so damn\nmixed up?"}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1064690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1061670, "text": "Rob, you're cutting off my circulation."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1069010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1066870, "text": "You're lucky that's all I'm cutting off."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1074630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1070990, "text": "Now, you're going back to jail even if I\nhave to drag you there."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1076110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1074890, "text": "Why? Why?"}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1078590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1077330, "text": "Because it's my duty."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1084350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1079490, "text": "And because, after waiting all this time\nto find somebody I care about, I'm not"}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1085490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1084350, "text": "letting him go that easy."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1088790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1087690, "text": "You'd really wait for me?"}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1091490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1090050, "text": "Maybe. Maybe?"}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1095010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1092490, "text": "Maybe's a lot better than you'll get if\nyou go through that door."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1097950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1096690, "text": "Are you saying I have a choice?"}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1100210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1098810, "text": "Or are you going to tackle me again?"}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1103170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1102110, "text": "I'm not saying anything."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1107030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1104090, "text": "But if you do go, I'm just a memory."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1119860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1117840, "text": "Okay. Go ahead. Put the cups on me."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1125120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1124000, "text": "Just like last night."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1132920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1130220, "text": "Don't worry, Miss Sullivan. I'm sure Roz\nis going to be just fine."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1135880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1133340, "text": "Your Honor, I've had it with these\nroaches."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1137540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1136540, "text": "You're giving up?"}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1140540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1138000, "text": "Yep. They whipped me pretty good, Your\nHonor."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1142080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1141080, "text": "Me."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1144720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1142280, "text": "The same guy who beat back the earwigs\nin 83."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1148300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1146560, "text": "I tried everything, Your Honor."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1149720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1148720, "text": "Nothing works."}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1151340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1150340, "text": "Not even this."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1153860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1152760, "text": "Roach nuke?"}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1157740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1155880, "text": "I used three cans of that yesterday."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1160040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1159040, "text": "Zip."}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1163840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1160280, "text": "Mark, it says here on the label it takes\n24 hours to have any effect."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1165600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1164420, "text": "Really? Uh -huh."}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1166900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1165900, "text": "Well, let me see."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1173080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1167580, "text": "I set the cans off about this time last\nnight, so that would make it 10 plus 2"}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1174120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1173080, "text": "plus 12."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1180700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1179700, "text": "All right!"}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1184520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1181820, "text": "Well, I guess they finally met their\nequals."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1186640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1185640, "text": "Oh, God."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1188960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1187060, "text": "Please let that be a pebble in my shoe."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1194140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1192880, "text": "I'm warning you, pal."}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1195760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1194660, "text": "Where is Morgan?"}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1197600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1196600, "text": "Uh, Harry Morgan?"}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1200860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1199860, "text": "Still on mash."}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1206150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1204590, "text": "All right, detective, what's your\nproblem?"}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1211390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1206530, "text": "One of my men saw your bailiff with a\nman resembling James Morgan's"}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1212950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1211890, "text": "Is that true, Bull?"}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1215130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1213750, "text": "Uh, James Morgan?"}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1216630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1215390, "text": "Could you describe him again?"}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1221190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1217090, "text": "The black male, 6 '4\", 230 pounds."}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1223330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1221630, "text": "And don't forget the killer bun."}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1231930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1227110, "text": "Well, Morgan, you're gonna be away for a\nlong time."}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1234050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1232550, "text": "I hope she was worth it."}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1236530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1235530, "text": "She was worth it."}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1238510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1237130, "text": "All right, let's go."}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1243130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1241810, "text": "Harry, you gotta do something."}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1245950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1243430, "text": "He wanted to come back, but I turned the\npoor man to jelly."}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1249290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1246610, "text": "Ross, they trusted him to return, and he\ndidn't. I know."}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1250550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1249550, "text": "He brought this on himself."}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": 1252350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1250770, "text": "I know. It's a very serious offense."}
{"cue": 343, "end_ms": 1254370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1252710, "text": "I know. Okay, I'll see what I can do."}
{"cue": 344, "end_ms": 1262350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1255550, "text": "Detective, I'm just hoping that James'\npunishment doesn't"}
{"cue": 345, "end_ms": 1263370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1262350, "text": "outweigh his crime."}
{"cue": 346, "end_ms": 1266000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1264260, "text": "Don't worry, Judge. You'll get the\nmaximum."}
{"cue": 347, "end_ms": 1268200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1266240, "text": "I go by the strict letter of the law."}
{"cue": 348, "end_ms": 1269760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1268760, "text": "So do I."}
{"cue": 349, "end_ms": 1272280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1270120, "text": "That's why I'm going to have to place\nyou under arrest."}
{"cue": 350, "end_ms": 1274300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1273280, "text": "What's the charge?"}
{"cue": 351, "end_ms": 1276780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1275780, "text": "Donut theft."}
{"cue": 352, "end_ms": 1278940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1277940, "text": "These are mine."}
{"cue": 353, "end_ms": 1284340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1280500, "text": "And you ate three, no, four of them\nwithout my permission."}
{"cue": 354, "end_ms": 1285980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1284900, "text": "Oh, come on."}
{"cue": 355, "end_ms": 1287740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1286660, "text": "What's it worth, about a dollar?"}
{"cue": 356, "end_ms": 1292210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1288370, "text": "It's a misdemeanor punishable by one\nyear in jail and a thousand dollar fine,"}
{"cue": 357, "end_ms": 1294870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1292410, "text": "and I go by the strict letter of the\nlaw."}
{"cue": 358, "end_ms": 1299470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1298470, "text": "You're crazy."}
{"cue": 359, "end_ms": 1301710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1300530, "text": "That's what they tell me."}
{"cue": 360, "end_ms": 1305710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1303410, "text": "Roz, you want to cuff the good detective\nhere?"}
{"cue": 361, "end_ms": 1309710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1306290, "text": "Sure. But don't go thinking this is\ngoing to lead to anything."}
{"cue": 362, "end_ms": 1310970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1309970, "text": "All right."}
{"cue": 363, "end_ms": 1314430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1312250, "text": "I'll tell him the guy turned himself in."}
{"cue": 364, "end_ms": 1319520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1315170, "text": "And you'll probably only get a... A\ncouple of months and a slap on the"}
{"cue": 365, "end_ms": 1327600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1323620, "text": "Before I go, there's a certain young\nlady I'd like to thank."}
{"cue": 366, "end_ms": 1331420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1328640, "text": "Oh, James, you don't have to thank me."}
{"cue": 367, "end_ms": 1340720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1333740, "text": "Oh, you meant... You see me when"}
{"cue": 368, "end_ms": 1341720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1340720, "text": "I get out?"}
{"cue": 369, "end_ms": 1343120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1342120, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 370, "end_ms": 1360060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1358800, "text": "I can't promise to be faithful."}
{"cue": 371, "end_ms": 1363360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1362360, "text": "I can."}
{"cue": 372, "end_ms": 1373300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1369800, "text": "Well, if you guys will excuse me, I'd\nlike a moment alone with Bull."}
{"cue": 373, "end_ms": 1375220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1374220, "text": "Sure. Oh, yeah."}
{"cue": 374, "end_ms": 1379640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1377440, "text": "I'd like to talk to you about what you\ndid up on the roof."}
{"cue": 375, "end_ms": 1383180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1379920, "text": "Oh, that's okay, Roz. You don't have to\nsay... What the hell is the matter with"}
{"cue": 376, "end_ms": 1385660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1383180, "text": "you? You knew how I felt about James."}
{"cue": 377, "end_ms": 1388570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1385950, "text": "You never leave a prisoner with someone\nwho might let him go."}
{"cue": 378, "end_ms": 1393210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1388790, "text": "You could have lost your job. And don't\nyou ever do anything like that again. Do"}
{"cue": 379, "end_ms": 1394210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1393210, "text": "you hear me?"}
{"cue": 380, "end_ms": 1398910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1395950, "text": "Yes, ma 'am."}
{"cue": 381, "end_ms": 1401730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1400730, "text": "Good."}
{"cue": 382, "end_ms": 1402970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1401970, "text": "Now bend over."}
